  "page_title": "'Quickstart: Generate images with Azure OpenAI Service and Azure OpenAI Studio'",
  "page_description": "Learn how to generate images with Azure OpenAI Service in the DALL-E playground (Preview) in Azure OpenAI Studio.",
  "page_date": "08/08/2023",
  "chunk_title": "Prerequisites",
  "chunk_content": "Prerequisites  #### DALL-E 3  - An Azure subscription. <a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/free/ai-services\" target=\"_blank\">Create one for free</a>. - An Azure OpenAI resource created in the `EastUS`, `AustraliaEast`, or `SwedenCentral` region. - Then, you need to deploy a `dalle3` model with your Azure resource. For more information, see Create a resource and deploy a model with Azure OpenAI.  #### DALL-E 2 (preview)  - An Azure subscription. <a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/free/ai-services\" target=\"_blank\">Create one for free</a>. - An Azure OpenAI resource created in the `EastUS` region. For more information, see Create a resource and deploy a model with Azure OpenAI.  ---",
